  "findings": [
    "New portrait hero has a clear visual hierarchy and preserves its 1122 by 1402 proportions at all reviewed sizes. The sofa, relaxed adult pose and hanging arm remain distinguishable at 320px without excessive empty space.",
    "The two-line baked headline ČIA GERA / GRĮŽTI. is complete and legible at 320px. Č and Ž carons and the Į ogonek are correct; no letter or accent is clipped.",
    "The hero sofa is visually consistent with the selected orange 180 catalog reference in ribbed upholstery, two back cushions, broad arms and single bench seat. Studio illumination naturally changes its tonal appearance.",
    "All body copy and category names remain readable with intact Lithuanian diacritics in normal and stripped modes. No squeezed text columns or detached CTAs were found.",
    "The complete 10 EUR offer, SVEIKI10 code and 56px filled primary CTA fit at 320px without clipping. Category CTA geometry is at least 44px; consultation and unsubscribe anchors are 46px high.",
    "Category photos retain their square proportions and remain directly followed by their matching title, caption and CTA. DOM metrics confirm the photo and CTA destinations match.",
    "Category cards stack below 600px and in every reviewed stripped layout. At 600px and above the normal layout switches cleanly to two aligned columns; the 600px email stays centered on wider viewports.",
    "All eight public HTTPS images loaded in every reviewed capture. Current metrics show no horizontal overflow and no dash punctuation in visible customer copy or alt text."
